  "title": "Scheduler commands queued at shutdown are leaked",
  "description": "agent_change_property() queues a scheduler_command with a property copy; indigo_cancel_pending_handlers() in detach drops queued handlers without freeing their data. Only commands arriving in the last moment before unload leak. Next: track queued commands or drain them in detach.\n\nImported from .factory/findings/archive/FND-20261112184305-e0a6-scheduler-agent-core-004.json (category: quality, blocking: no).",
